@startuml
title HSS activation fallout - Order fallout resolution (automatic, successful)

participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
participant "Event\nManagement" as Event #grey
participant "Fallout\nManagement" as FM #lightgrey
participant "Resource Activation\nand Configuration" as RAC #blue
participant "HSS"

note right of FM : continued from\nchapter 5.1.1.3

FM -> FM : 1 Update fallout\n(state='Processing/Resolving')

FM -> Event : 2 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event falloutStateChange (falloutId, state="Processing/Resolving")
activate Event
Event --> FM : 3 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event

FM -> RAC : 4 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nDELETE /resource (HSS subscriber profile)
activate RAC
RAC --> FM : 5 **TMF702** 202 Accepted\n(HSS subscriber profile, monitorRef)

RAC -> HSS : 6 **HSS API**\n"Remove HSS subscriber"
activate HSS
HSS --> RAC : 7 Subscriber removed
deactivate HSS

FM -> RAC : 8 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nGET /monitor (monitorRef)
RAC --> FM : 9 **TMF702** 200 OK\n(monitorState="Completed")
deactivate RAC

FM -> FM : 10 Update fallout\n(state="Completed", result="resolved")

FM -> Event : 11 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event falloutStateChange\n(falloutId, state="Completed", result="resolved")
activate Event
Event --> FM : 12 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event

FM -> ROM : 13 **TMF652 Resource Order Management**\nPATCH resourceOrder\n(resourceOrderId, resourceOrderItemId, falloutResult="resolved")
activate ROM

ROM -> ROM : 14 update resourceOrderItem\nand resourceOrder (state="InProgress")

ROM -> Event : 15 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="InProgress",\nresourceOrderState="InProgress")
activate Event
Event --> ROM : 16 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event

ROM -> RAC : 17 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nPOST /resource (HSS subscriber profile)
activate RAC
RAC --> ROM : 18 **TMF702** 202 Accepted (HSS subscriber profile, monitorRef)

RAC -> HSS : 19 **HSS API** (HSS subscriber profile)
activate HSS
HSS --> RAC : 20 Subscribed created
deactivate HSS

ROM -> RAC : 21 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nGET /monitor (monitorRef)
RAC --> ROM : 22 **TMF702** 200 OK (monitorState="Completed")
deactivate RAC

ROM -> ROM : 23 update resourceOrderItem\n(state="Completed")

ROM -> RI : 24 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource\n(HSS subscriber profile, resourceStatus="available")
activate RI
RI --> ROM : 25 **TMF639** 200 OK (resource)
deactivate RI
deactivate ROM

@enduml
